  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participation of Women in political leadership and Increased Awareness on GBV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to achieve the outcome of women with increased opportunities and skills to participate in leadership positions, the project will identify and profile positive role of women in leadership at various levels; collaborate with stakeholders on electoral laws and the 50/50 campaign on enhancing women participation in politics; and use awareness raising campaigns on women leadership by working with the media.  Awareness raising campaigns on Gender Based Violence (GBV) through various structures including women and youth structures during annual commemorations will be done in order to have a positive shift in knowledge, attitudes and behaviours towards GBV</narrative>
  </description>
